Maintainer: palOS <joe.lucas0413@gmail.com>
Architecture: all
Version: 1.0.0
Replaces: xsane
Depends: sane-utils
Recommends: sane-airscan
Description: Scanner for palOS
 Scan documents and photos with any scanner the computer can see, on USB or on
 the network: an overview to choose the part to scan, colour, greyscale or black
 and white, any resolution the scanner offers, and every page in a document
 feeder in one go. Saves as PDF (several pages in one file), JPEG, PNG or TIFF.
 In English and French.
